    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Looking to purchase your 1st home in a mature and established location? Or are you keen to downsize to a low maintenance ground floor private apartment close to amenities? No. 2 could be for you !!! Lovingly maintained and presented by the current owner occupiers, this beautiful well proportioned 2 bed apartment is located in this very sought after residential development in the idyllic village of Kill. Offering excellent accommodation, 2 parking spaces and well maintained communal areas, this fine property is sure to impress.\r\nContact us @ www.cme.ie to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: c. 5.2m x 1.1m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Coving to ceiling. Hot press and large storage press.\r\n\r\nLounge/Diningroom: c. 6.3m x 3.5m\r\nSpacious open plan room with French doors to private decked patio. Laminate wood floor. Attractive fireplace housing electric fire on Marble hearth. Coving to ceiling. Double doors to ….\r\n\r\nSeparate Kitchen: c. 4.0m x 2.15m\r\nWith good range of Shaker style wall and floor units incorporating integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher & fridge freezer. Laminate wood flooring. Tiled Splashback\r\n \r\nBedroom 1: c. 4.2 m x 4.0m\r\nLaminated wood flooring. Double floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite: c. 1.8 m x 1.5m\r\nTiled floor. Plumbed for ensuite currently used as walk in wardrobe space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.9m x 2.1m\r\nLaminated wood flooring. Floor to ceiling wardrobes with additional shelving.\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 3.9m x 2.1m\r\nWith bath, WC and wash hand basing. Tiled flooring and mostly tiled walls.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo the front there are 2 allocated parking spaces. Gated access to communal gardens which are well maintained and laid in lawn with mature Silver Birch trees. No. 2 has a railed and decked patio overlooking the gardens, ideal for Al Fresco dining or your morning coffee."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 bedroom ground floor apartment in a block of just 4 units \r\n2 parking spaces \r\nSpacious proportions c. 71 sqm\r\nOpen plan Lounge/Dining area \r\nSeparate kitchen\r\nPlumbed for ensuite currently utilized as a walk in wardrobe\r\nGood storage throughout \r\nPrivate railed & decked patio overlooking gardens\r\nGas central heating\r\nSought after residential location\r\nManagement fees c.900 pa"
      },
      {
